WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.500
<v Uncle Ray>Before the street wakes up and improves the story, take this to Coleman.</v>

00:06.500 --> 00:08.500
<v Dee>You owed him money?</v>

00:08.500 --> 00:11.500
<v Uncle Ray>Worse. I owed him the last word.</v>

00:11.500 --> 00:19.500
<v Pat>In nineteen eighty-one, that token bought the loser a haircut and the winner the right to stop talking.</v>

00:23.000 --> 00:30.000
<v June>If that's Ray's token in your hand, wipe your feet twice. Once for the street, once for the history.</v>
